      "collection": "Dialogs",
      "key": "line:Wifefema_Armpit_0a90fd3",
      "source": "Wifefema: Я тут не на подиуме, мне удобство важнее.",
      "target": "Wifefema: Nem kifutón vagyok, nekem a kényelem fontosabb.",
      "authoredFile": "Translations/hu/dialogue-batch-447.json",
      "reviewResult": "pass"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15180,
      "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452182581254",
      "collection": "Dialogs",
      "key": "line:Wifefema_Armpit_068a65d",
      "source": "Wifefema: Чем это таким он меня заразил, падла?",
      "target": "Wifefema: Mivel fertőzött meg az a rohadék?",
      "authoredFile": "Translations/hu/dialogue-batch-447.json",
      "reviewResult": "pass"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15181,
      "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452182581253",
      "collection": "Dialogs",
      "key": "line:Wifefema_Armpit_019c86b",
      "source": "Wifefema: Я на прощание мужа обняла, а через день как начало чесаться.",
      "target": "Wifefema: Búcsúzóul átöleltem a férjem, és másnap viszketni kezdett.",
      "authoredFile": "Translations/hu/dialogue-batch-447.json",
      "reviewResult": "pass"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15182,
      "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452182581252",
      "collection": "Dialogs",
      "key": "line:Wifefema_Armpit_0ac1091",
      "source": "Wifefema: ...",
      "target": "Wifefema: ...",
      "authoredFile": "Translations/hu/dialogue-batch-040.json",
